<title>FINLAND: Rauma 1996 profit rises 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Rauma 1996 profit rises 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   679 vs 671</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   9.15 vs 9.32</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    2.75 vs 2.50</p>
<p> Net sales					 10,220 vs 9,837</p>
<p> Operating profit				   710 vs 742</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts' forecasts had been for a profit after financial items of 682 million markka (mean 679 million) in a 553 million to 750 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Gross profit				     2,865 vs 2,776</p>
<p>Share in result of associated companies gain 2 vs 3 charge  Net financial items			charge 33 vs 68 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			charge 34 vs 46 charge</p>
<p> Minorities					gain 1 vs 2 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						  186 vs 179</p>
<p> Net profit					   460 vs 448</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    44.0 vs 40.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Rauma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
